        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"24cfe637-3d6f-43ab-8db5-17e48dbc7fc6\",\"review_text\":\"Not a single ad love it 💕\"},{\"review_id\":\"b4f2e308-dd09-4bad-b062-9f721fdfa3ef\",\"review_text\":\"Lots of great playlists and songs. I can find most of the songs that I want to listen to. Really enjoy the AI DJ as well. However, the app would disconnect randomly when I play music on any of my smart speakers.\"},{\"review_id\":\"c6911fa5-e1a4-49e6-82ad-6ce16414a15e\",\"review_text\":\"This is the goodmusic aap\"},{\"review_id\":\"bd448c53-880c-437f-b015-e44a48438566\",\"review_text\":\"Always the best 5 star⭐️⭐️\"},{\"review_id\":\"b9c60b1c-9ac1-412d-94e2-b8852e4c8b11\",\"review_text\":\"Plays ad after watching a video for no ads So i watched an ad to get 30 minutes of uninterrupted listening just for it to play an another ad after listening to one song like bruh the song was only 2 Mins i dont like the integrity of this app must FIX\"},{\"review_id\":\"c9bfd4a1-696f-4c35-8d53-9c1d22cc44ed\",\"review_text\":\"It was good earlier not now\"},{\"review_id\":\"39b37bed-1e1c-45dd-a485-cab19a535d36\",\"review_text\":\"Love All Your Music.\"},{\"review_id\":\"f1bd4ad3-af1e-484f-b72b-e38722504e28\",\"review_text\":\"Pretty great when it works 😄\"},{\"review_id\":\"ea14038e-d21d-476e-bb7a-b9b1eb425bad\",\"review_text\":\"Stop stopping my music\"},{\"review_id\":\"8d34c5bb-d933-4402-9328-62a228ba0e7b\",\"review_text\":\"I have been using Spotify since 2019 and it was pretty good then but now it has become worst due to premium subscription.You can't use basic features like which part of the song you want to play or add a song to your queue.\"},{\"review_id\":\"67dd96a8-5700-41b0-9f9d-d9ab779ff48d\",\"review_text\":\"Bad App 😡\"},{\"review_id\":\"36782abb-e13a-4c22-8af7-90326660b4b3\",\"review_text\":\"The best app I ever had\"},{\"review_id\":\"e99ae8f3-2c13-444a-a855-c0d33404d31b\",\"review_text\":\"Now each and every thing is premium, now cannot even skip or play specific parts of the songs. each and every thing is premium,I started hating spotify now, gonnaa delete it right now !!!!\"},{\"review_id\":\"8bbc2da7-df14-4c9e-b60b-7f6c728b588d\",\"review_text\":\"New update is suckssssss\"},{\"review_id\":\"0ed3c8a7-a4ad-40df-9a87-6f3e3bcf4eda\",\"review_text\":\"Guuu app\"},{\"review_id\":\"fc7bf8a4-0e5f-4ec8-ad59-c7d67d55ada0\",\"review_text\":\"3 rd class app....they ask money in every step🤬.. don't install\"},{\"review_id\":\"85d6d770-d900-442b-afa5-ef19a871eabb\",\"review_text\":\"Can u read user habit better. If they never listen to podcast then don't suggest any of it, i don't like to listen to ppl around me why would i listen to these sok asik mfs. Playing on shuffle now works weirdly, the shuffle isn't shuffling. Also, when playing music from playlist then stopping midway, closing the app, reopening it, it won't play the next song 😩 really bad experience\"},{\"review_id\":\"915a25a8-1eac-4a72-bf25-e6b19bbfcfba\",\"review_text\":\"Notice music will randomly stop playing, I can't lock my screen and I can't leave the app. App will not play in background while I do other stuff with my phone. Never had this problem it has been doing this for about a month. The app plays fine on my Google speakers. Very irrating!\"},{\"review_id\":\"71398d37-ca2d-4d4b-96cf-53a434e79361\",\"review_text\":\"Does the touch of my hand work? I can't change the song? An annoying app.\"},{\"review_id\":\"271c7251-baee-4e1a-ac8c-6ca6a0f25bce\",\"review_text\":\"Mbakws appp\"}]}"
      }
